# Claude Desktop: merge into $DIR/home/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (`mcpdef connect claude-desktop --write` does it)
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "mcpdef": {
      "args": [
        "bridge",
        "https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp",
        "--ca",
        "$DIR/state/tls/ca.crt"
      ],
      "command": "$MCPDEF"
    }
  }
}

The bridge trusts the gateway's CA itself ($DIR/state/tls/ca.crt): nothing to add to the system.
